{"agent_id":"pp3g-w20v-task-rebuild-the-hub-reduced-issues-projection-in-the","agent_seq":6,"timestamp":"2026-08-06T14:02:27.780532120Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"1f2b3808-3b73-48b5-9fc6-86719bc50eee","comment_uuid":"289f02a4-fbad-4f59-ae3f-7ea2883dac46","author":"pp3g-w20v-task-rebuild-the-hub-reduced-issues-projection-in-the","content":"RESULT (2026-08-06, pp3g-w20v): mechanism investigation complete — **NO safe crosslink mechanism regenerates the reduced issues/ projection from v3 refs**. Task step 4 applies: exact manual procedure documented below instead of forcing anything. No fork code touched, no hub-cache mutation performed.\n\n== WHY NO MECHANISM EXISTS (source-verified) ==\nThe v2 worktree projection (.hub-cache/issues/) is a LEGACY artifact that v3 deliberately never maintains. Evidence:\n1. The ONLY function that writes worktree issues/*.json is materialize() (compaction.rs:1006), called solely from the v2 compaction path compaction::compact (compaction.rs:375, WorktreeSource). On a v3 hub, 'crosslink compact' refuses the v2 path and routes to compact_v3 (compact.rs:36,54) which is 'pure object-store plumbing, no worktree writes' (hub_v3.rs:1510-1520).\n2. 'crosslink sync' on v3 hydrates SQLite from the reduced v3 state (RefHubSource + reduce + hydrate_from_state, locks_cmd.rs:263-265); it never writes worktree files.\n3. 'crosslink migrate hub-v3' is v2→v3 direction (build_genesis_from_files, migrate_hub_v3.rs:747); --finalize refuses on ASES per #142 verdict.\n4. 'crosslink migrate to-shared' on v3 routes to to_shared_v3 (event-log promotion of SQLite-only issues, migrate.rs:213-330) — no worktree writes.\n5. 'crosslink integrity hydration --repair' on v3 re-hydrates SQLite from the reduced state (integrity_cmd.rs:124-134,335-336) — no worktree writes.\n6. 'crosslink prune' is git-history only.\n7. Even the v3 checkpoint's OWN browse tree (issues/<uuid>.json on refs/heads/crosslink/checkpoint) is stale: 4 files from 2026-06-23 vs 232 issues in state.json. compact_v3's idempotency guard (hub_v3.rs:1594-1614) + incremental browse ops (hub_v3.rs:1616, full=!browse_present) prevent a full rebuild once README.md exists.\n\n== LIVE STATE (verified this session) ==\n- .hub-cache/issues/ = 4 June-era files (55991f4c/56547c9d/c8097b1a/f4919301) + empty comments.db; meta/counters.json next_display_id=5 (STALE).\n- refs/heads/crosslink/checkpoint:state.json = 232 issues, next_display_id=235, display_id_map 234, no collisions, no negative ids (MODERN — this IS the v3 reduced projection).\n- 'crosslink issue list -s all' = 232; sync hydrates 232 with NO display-id collision warning.\n- Gate (ade6146b) behavior confirmed live in installed binary: marker mismatch does not wipe (232 intact).\n\n== EXACT MANUAL PROCEDURE (if the operator wants the v2 dir to reflect modern state) ==\nOption A — #142-validated immediate repair (recommended; makes the stale v2 path inert):\n  rm -rf /home/claude-code/projects/ASES/.crosslink/.hub-cache/issues\n  # reversible: git -C /home/claude-code/projects/ASES/.crosslink/.hub-cache checkout -- issues\n  # Effect: read_all_issue_files returns empty for missing dir (issue_file.rs:225-230)\n  #         -> hydrate_to_sqlite early-returns (hydration.rs:126-128)\n  #         -> maybe_auto_hydrate degrades to harmless marker refresh\n  # FOOTGUN: restore the dir BEFORE any 'crosslink migrate hub-v3 --remigrate-from-v2'\n  #          (build_genesis_from_files reads those files, migrate_hub_v3.rs:747)\nOption B — full v2-format rebuild from v3 state (manual, git-level; NOT a crosslink command):\n  1. Extract reduced state: git -C /home/claude-code/projects/ASES/.crosslink/.hub-cache show refs/heads/crosslink/checkpoint:state.json > /tmp/state.json   (232 issues)\n  2. Render each issue to issues/<uuid>.json in the v2 IssueFile layout (the layout hydrate_to_sqlite reads) — replicating compact_to_issue_file/IssueFile::from(&CompactIssue) (compaction.rs:1085). No CLI exposes this conversion.\n  3. Write meta/counters.json with next_display_id from state.json (235).\n  4. git add + commit in the hub-cache worktree (checked out on crosslink/hub).\n  # NOTE: v3 never does this by design; the v2 dir is inert to the v3 gate either way.\nOption C — v3-native: the modern reduced projection ALREADY exists as checkpoint state.json + the checkpoint browse tree. If the checkpoint browse tree needs a full rebuild, it requires git surgery to make browse_present=false (remove README.md from the tree) then 'crosslink compact' — NOT recommended; touches hub state every agent reads.\n\n== ACCEPTANCE STATUS ==\n- Projection rebuilt: NOT executed (no safe mechanism).\n- Exact manual procedure: DOCUMENTED above and in Research Addendum 04 (updated).\n- Issue list intact: 232, no collision warning.\n- No fork code touched: confirmed (fork worktree clean).\n#233 left open.","created_at":"2026-08-06T14:02:27.771446848Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:mnzZUiZYbWbkCmYT841sUfzxk6ejYNtO+bzcEp7B4VQ","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgvRL8I3BHtktxO9lIcKE52i2txj1OSra0a9QlMFbYEjwAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAlEqfNvVX58SCisiT+8/i+RfHivr121JYCowUP2j8pKHj8aExXj6hUDV7WoEb8F0k49xkjq5gi1V05wp3ytWjBw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:mnzZUiZYbWbkCmYT841sUfzxk6ejYNtO+bzcEp7B4VQ","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgvRL8I3BHtktxO9lIcKE52i2txj1OSra0a9QlMFbYEjwAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQP4LfsETAmV4FkeFT2gQiNe1Zhl+CsvFXovTtbt7DgqDWQkWR3xBMIl3r1AOUAh8au6uAgqARBSVCTN3Z1G7Gwo="}
